{"mode":"training","language":"en","altTextLanguage":"","title":"","instruction":{"english":"","german":""},"allowInstructionLineBreaks":false,"readingText":{"instruction":{"german":"","english":""},"content":"","configs":[]},"sequences":[{"instruction":{"german":"<p>Read the rules, then choose the correct options to complete the conversation.<\/p>","english":""},"configs":[{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"a little","correct":true},{"answer":"a few","correct":false}],"id":"dropdown_0","type":"dropdown","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_3\/p41_ex4\/"},{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"a little","correct":false},{"answer":"lots of","correct":true}],"id":"dropdown_2","type":"dropdown","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_3\/p41_ex4\/"},{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"a few","correct":true},{"answer":"a little","correct":false}],"id":"dropdown_3","type":"dropdown","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_3\/p41_ex4\/"},{"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"a lot of","correct":true},{"answer":"a few","correct":false}],"id":"dropdown_4","type":"dropdown","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_3\/p41_ex4\/"}],"staticConfigs":[],"parts":["<p><b>Grammar | <em>a few \/ a little \/ a lot of \/ lots of<\/em><\/b><\/p><p>We usually use <em>a few<\/em> and <em>a little<\/em> with affirmative sentences.<\/p><p>\u2022 We use <em>a few<\/em> with countable nouns and <em>a little<\/em> with uncountable nouns: <em>We\u2019ve got a few potatoes. I need a little rice<\/em>.<\/p><p>We can use <em>a lot of<\/em> or <em>lots of<\/em> with countable and uncountable nouns: <em>We\u2019ve got a lot of milk and lots of bananas.<\/em><\/p><p><em><span class=\"ql-cursor\">\ufeff<\/span><\/em><\/p><p><b>A:<\/b> What\u2019s for lunch?<\/p><p><b>B:<\/b> We\u2019ve got <sup>1<\/sup> <dropdown id=\"dropdown_0\"><\/dropdown> pasta, <sup>2<\/sup> <dropdown id=\"dropdown_2\"><\/dropdown> carrots and <sup>3<\/sup> <dropdown id=\"dropdown_3\"><\/dropdown> onions.<\/p><p>I can make some soup.<\/p><p><b>A:<\/b> Yes! Great idea! Make <sup>4<\/sup> <dropdown id=\"dropdown_4\"><\/dropdown> soup \u2013 I\u2019m hungry!<\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[],"staticText":{"text":"<p><br><\/p>","backgroundColor":"lightgray","isSet":false}}]}